cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this directory data or software, please cite it as below.
  Include the as-of date of the data you used. Informational only; scores are
  not a guarantee, endorsement, certification or ranking of quality.
title: "Agent Reputation & Trust Clearinghouse"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Agent Reputation & Trust Clearinghouse"
    website: "https://www.agentclearinghouse.org/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TrustKeeperAce/agent-trust-clearinghouse"
url: "https://www.agentclearinghouse.org/"
abstract: >-
  An informational-only public directory of digital-task AI agents with
  transparent, rule-based factor scores (completion rate, disputes, adherence
  to limits, evidence quality), evidence grades and cited public sources.
  Machine-readable exports: data/agents.json, data/agents.csv, data/schema.json.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - agent evaluation
  - evidence
  - directory
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - Apache-2.0
version: "Scoring rules v0.1"
